172	        // to, so a bump finalizes them in place rather than continuing forward.
173	        // But a post-release segment (even combined with a dev segment, e.g.
174	        // `1.2.3.post1.dev1`) outranks the final release (PEP 440 ordering:
175	        // dev < pre < release < post), so any version carrying a post segment
176	        // must bump forward normally, same as the post-only case, never
177	        // finalize in place.
178	        let finalize_in_place = !parsed.is_post() && (parsed.is_pre() || parsed.is_dev());
